B4User can import and convert records from nvidia/Nemotron-Personas-Korea.
That dataset is published separately under CC BY 4.0 by NVIDIA and
contributors. Converted records preserve source attribution metadata through
metadata.source_dataset and metadata.source_license.

Nemotron-Personas-Korea:
https://huggingface.co/datasets/nvidia/Nemotron-Personas-Korea

The B4User evaluation outputs are synthetic-persona hypotheses. They are not
real user research, market-demand forecasts, employee research findings, or
production safety approvals.
